test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:11:10:
   |
11 | onSum :: Mode(Map) -> Mode
   |          ^
Mode is a sum; pick a variant with "." instead of arguments

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:12:13:
   |
12 | onAtomic :: A(B) -> A
   |             ^
A takes no arguments

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:12:13:
   |
12 | onAtomic :: A(B) -> A
   |             ^
warning: onAtomic changes one A of a list, but doesn't say which; to pick it, give As a key (As = [A by Id]) and use an element path, such as As[id](...)

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:13:21:
   |
13 | onNoPayload :: Page.Home(A) -> Page.Home
   |                     ^
Page.Home takes no arguments

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:14:17:
   |
14 | tooMany :: Page.Plan(Mode.Map * Mode.Plot) -> Page.Home
   |                 ^
Page.Plan takes one argument, Mode, but 2 are given

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:15:24:
   |
15 | wrongType :: Page.Plan(A) -> Page.Home
   |                        ^
expected Mode here, not A

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:16:24:
   |
16 | wrongList :: Page.Many(Bs) -> Page.Pick(One)
   |                        ^
expected As here, not Bs

test/check/error-bad-arguments.sumspec:16:36:
   |
16 | wrongList :: Page.Many(Bs) -> Page.Pick(One)
   |                                    ^
Page.Pick is a sum; pick a variant with "." instead of arguments

